  Balance: in A, `volumes/pgdata/.snapshots/` also exists holding an unrelated older `wal-old.tar`;
  in B, `backups/` exists holding an unrelated `config.tar` (configs only).
- Operation: `rm -rf volumes/pgdata`.
- restore_script:
